the sequence ${a}_{n}=\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡(100n)}{n\\sqrt{n}}$ for $n\\ge 1$ converge or diverge? If the sequence converges, what is its limit?" :question/worked-solution "Recall that for large values of $n,$ we have\n\n$$\nn!≫{e}^{n}≫{n}^{m}≫\\operatorname{ln}⁡(n),\n$$\n\nwhere $≫$ means \"much greater than,\" and $m>0.$\n\nWe calculate the limit of the sequence as $n$ approaches infinity:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{a}_{n}={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡(100n)}{n\\sqrt{n}}\n$$\n\nBoth the numerator and denominator approach infinity as $n\\to \\infty .$ However, the denominator is growing much faster than the numerator, and we conclude that\n\n$$\n{lim}_{n\\to \\infty }\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡(100n)}{n\\sqrt{n}}=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sequence converges,  and its limit is $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-123707/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "37e00ff7-a91e-5b56-9f3a-24e7318cf004"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123707"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123714/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "410c7c1d-3d7a-5045-a258-e543f110a569" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123714/selection/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261" :answer/id #uuid "04fc6693-9aa3-5041-96df-f89d92ba5ae4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123714/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "3f1c2eaa-6b51-5f14-8ed0-764d61f58df9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123714/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "f6b04115-b3fc-5205-8e9a-02656bf30804" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123714/selection/a17c7bfd1556c549e72b2ad67685fc333175f26ac2a336a4ff04a96a28a6e7f0" :answer/id #uuid "6f047844-de48-5145-a031-3fc7f046f591" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The sequence diverges." :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123714/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c124ee9-94cf-5539-b964-4c65589210ec" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123714/selection/a17c7bfd1556c549e72b2ad67685fc333175f26ac2a336a4ff04a96a28a6e7f0" :answer-field/choices ["q-123714/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-123714/selection/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261" "q-123714/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-123714/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-123714/selection/a17c7bfd1556c549e72b2ad67685fc333175f26ac2a336a4ff04a96a28a6e7f0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123714" :question/id #uuid "07f019fc-52c4-5337-bbad-e5807016d73f" :question/math-academy-id "q-123714" :question/problem "What is the limit of the sequence ${a}_{n}=\\frac{{e}^{n/10}}{{log}_{5}⁡n}-1$ for $n\\ge 1?$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that for large values of $n,$ we have\n\n$$\nn!≫{e}^{n}≫{n}^{m}≫\\operatorname{ln}⁡(n),\n$$\n\nwhere $≫$ means \"much greater than,\" and $m>0.$\n\nTo find the limit, we calculate\n\n$$\n{lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{a}_{n}={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }(\\frac{{e}^{n/10}}{{log}_{5}⁡n}-1)=-1+{lim}_{n\\to \\infty }\\frac{{e}^{n/10}}{{log}_{5}⁡n}.\n$$\n\nBoth the numerator and denominator approach infinity as $n\\to \\infty .$ However, the numerator is growing much faster than the denominator, and we conclude that\n\n$$\n{lim}_{n\\to \\infty }\\frac{{e}^{n/10}}{{log}_{5}⁡n}=\\infty .\n$$\n\nHence, \n\n$$\n{lim}_{n\\to \\infty }(\\frac{{e}^{n/10}}{{log}_{5}⁡n}-1)=\\infty .\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sequence diverges." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-123714/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "51d50237-f6cf-5c2d-b8d1-335378205a28"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123714"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
